    <bpmn:process id="W_W3529" name="W3529. Pallet &amp; RTI Pool Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual SCM planning (links to VS-33.1); network change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Group pallet/RTI estate
Owner: SCM / Packaging Engineering
Participants: SCM, Packaging Eng, Logistics (links to VS-06), DC Operations (links to VS-04), Finance (links to VS-17/VS-35), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Sustainability (links to VS-25)
Source: workflow W3529 — Pallet &amp; RTI Pool Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3529_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3529_Lane1" name="SCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3529_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3529_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3529_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3529_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3529_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3529_Start3" name="Annual SCM planning (links to VS-33.1); network change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3529_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3529_Task4" name="SCM/Packaging Eng set the pallet/RTI pool strategy: owned vs rented/pooled…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/Packaging Eng set the pallet/RTI pool strategy: owned vs rented/pooled (e.g., CHEP/LOSAL) vs exchange, pallet type/standard (EUR/ISO/stringer/plastic), RTI types (totes, roll cages, stillages, IBCs) by use-case, pool sizing and safety float, and the build-vs-rent economics; align to network volume (links to VS-04/VS-06) and sustainability (links to VS-25)
Responsible (R): SCM / Packaging Eng / Logistics
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3529_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3529_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3529_Task5" name="SCM/Finance model the total cost of ownership (TCO) per strategy: owned-pallet…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: SCM/Finance model the total cost of ownership (TCO) per strategy: owned-pallet capex/depreciation (links to VS-35), storage/handling, loss/write-off (W3533), retrieval/reverse (W3535), and rented-pool per-trip fees/deposits; select the optimal mix by lane/volume
Responsible (R): SCM / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3529_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3529_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3529_Task6" name="SCM/Procurement establish the pool program: pool-provider contracts (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SCM/Procurement establish the pool program: pool-provider contracts (links to VS-03/VS-34), exchange agreements with vendors/carriers (W3532), deposit accounting (links to VS-17/W3514), and the asset-master/RTI-tracking setup (links to VS-35/VS-29/W3531); report to governance (W3544)
Responsible (R): SCM / Procurement / Finance
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3529_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3529_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3529_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3529_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3529_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-563 (ensure controlled execution — Pallet &amp; RTI Pool, Tracking &amp; Reconciliation (PA-111.2).) | - operational: TCO modeling; operational: standardization
Owner: SCM / Packaging Engineering</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
