    <bpmn:process id="W_W3530" name="W3530. Pallet Procurement, Issuance &amp; Inventory Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pool need (W3529); replenishment
Frequency: Continuous + periodic procurement
Volume: Pallet inventory across 205 locations
Owner: SCM / DC Operations
Participants: SCM, DC Operations (links to VS-04), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Finance (links to VS-35/VS-17), Master Data (links to VS-29), Supplier
Source: workflow W3530 — Pallet Procurement, Issuance &amp; Inventory Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3530_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3530_Lane1" name="SCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3530_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3530_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3530_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3530_Lane2" name="DC">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3530_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3530_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3530_Start4" name="Pool need (W3529); replenishment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3530_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3530_Task5" name="SCM/Procurement procure owned pallets per spec (W3529): RFQ/framework (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/Procurement procure owned pallets per spec (W3529): RFQ/framework (links to VS-03), supplier qualification, quality/ISPM-15 compliance for wood (links to VS-87/VS-31), lead time, and price (timber/plastic commodity links to VS-106); manage make-vs-buy and import (links to VS-02.2)
Responsible (R): SCM / Procurement / Supplier
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3530_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3530_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3530_Task6" name="DC/SCM manage pallet inventory: track pallet stock by location (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC/SCM manage pallet inventory: track pallet stock by location (links to VS-29/W3531), issue pallets to putaway/pick/ship (links to VS-04.2), manage safety float, repair/maintenance of damaged pallets, and disposal of unserviceable pallets (links to VS-35.3/VS-73); register owned pallets as assets (links to VS-35)
Responsible (R): DC / SCM
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3530_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3530_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3530_Task7" name="SCM/Finance manage pallet asset accounting: capitalization/depreciation (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SCM/Finance manage pallet asset accounting: capitalization/depreciation (links to VS-35), pallet-inventory valuation (links to VS-17/W275), and pallet cost allocation to operations (links to W3514); track pallet utilization and idle stock
Responsible (R): SCM / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3530_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3530_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3530_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3530_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
