        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-563 (ensure controlled execution — Pallet &amp; RTI Pool, Tracking &amp; Reconciliation (PA-111.2).) | - operational: safety float and forecasting; operational: spec and inspection
Owner: SCM / DC Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
