    <bpmn:process id="W_W3531" name="W3531. RTI (Totes / Cages / Containers) Tracking &amp; Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: RTI program (W3529); daily operations
Frequency: Continuous + cycle reconciliation
Volume: RTI estate across DCs/stores/carriers
Owner: SCM / DC Operations
Participants: SCM, DC Operations (links to VS-04), Store (links to VS-07), Logistics (links to VS-06), Master Data (links to VS-29), IT (links to VS-27)
Source: workflow W3531 — RTI (Totes / Cages / Containers) Tracking &amp; Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3531_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3531_Lane1" name="SCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3531_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3531_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3531_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3531_Lane2" name="DC">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3531_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3531_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3531_Start4" name="RTI program (W3529); daily operations">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3531_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3531_Task5" name="SCM/IT establish RTI tracking: barcode/RFID tagging of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/IT establish RTI tracking: barcode/RFID tagging of totes/cages/stillages/IBCs (links to VS-29/VS-23), the RTI master and lifecycle states (in-DC, in-transit, at-store, at-customer, at-carrier, in-repair), and the tracking system (Oracle Transportation Execution/WMS links to VS-27); define the reconciliation cadence
Responsible (R): SCM / IT / Master Data
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Setup + maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3531_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3531_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3531_Task6" name="DC/Logistics/Store track RTI movement on every shipment/receipt (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC/Logistics/Store track RTI movement on every shipment/receipt (links to VS-04/VS-06/VS-07.3): scan in/out, capture custody (DC, carrier, store, customer), and update state; manage exceptions (unscanned, wrong-location, overdue)
Responsible (R): DC / Logistics / Store
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3531_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3531_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3531_Task7" name="SCM conduct cycle reconciliation of RTI by type/location/custody vs the master…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SCM conduct cycle reconciliation of RTI by type/location/custody vs the master (links to VS-05.1 cycle-count methodology), investigate variances (loss W3533, mis-scan, mis-placement), and recover mis-placed RTI (W3535); report RTI availability, utilization, and loss to analytics (W3540) and governance (W3544)
Responsible (R): SCM / DC / Finance
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Weekly/monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3531_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3531_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3531_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3531_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3531_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-79 (ensure RTI &amp; pallet asset reconciliation.) | - operational: RFID/barcode and reconciliation; operational: scan-in/out discipline
Owner: SCM / DC Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
