    <bpmn:process id="W_W3532" name="W3532. Pallet / RTI Deposit, Transfer &amp; Customer / Carrier Exchange" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pallet/RTI transferred to customer/carrier; exchange program
Frequency: Per transfer + continuous
Volume: Customer (trade) and carrier exchanges
Owner: SCM / Logistics
Participants: SCM, Logistics (links to VS-06), Trade Sales (links to VS-11), DC (links to VS-04), Store (links to VS-07), Finance/AR (links to VS-16/VS-15), Carrier (links to VS-110), Customer
Source: workflow W3532 — Pallet / RTI Deposit, Transfer &amp; Customer / Carrier Exchange</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3532_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3532_Lane1" name="SCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3532_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3532_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3532_Lane2" name="DC">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3532_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3532_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3532_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3532_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3532_Start5" name="Pallet/RTI transferred to customer/carrier; exchange program">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3532_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3532_Task6" name="SCM/Trade establish the pallet/RTI deposit and exchange terms: deposit value…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/Trade establish the pallet/RTI deposit and exchange terms: deposit value per pallet/RTI, exchange (like-for-like) vs transfer, customer/carrier accountability, and the accounting treatment (deposit liability links to VS-17); communicate to trade accounts (links to VS-11/VS-43) and carriers (links to VS-110/W3499)
Responsible (R): SCM / Trade / Finance
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Setup + maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3532_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3532_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3532_Task7" name="DC/Store/Logistics execute the exchange/transfer on delivery (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC/Store/Logistics execute the exchange/transfer on delivery (links to VS-06/VS-07.3/VS-74): scan pallets/RTI out to the customer/carrier, capture deposit liability, collect exchanged pallets/RTI on the next delivery, and reconcile; manage exceptions (short-return, damaged)
Responsible (R): DC / Store / Logistics
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Per delivery</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3532_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3532_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3532_Task8" name="Finance/AR manage the deposit accounting: post deposit liability on transfer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/AR manage the deposit accounting: post deposit liability on transfer (links to VS-17), refund/credit on return, charge for unreturned/damaged (W3533), and reconcile the deposit pool; report deposit liability and exchange compliance to analytics (W3540)
Responsible (R): Finance / AR
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3532_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3532_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3532_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3532_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3532_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-563 (ensure controlled execution — Pallet &amp; RTI Pool, Tracking &amp; Reconciliation (PA-111.2).) | - operational: deposit discipline and reconciliation; operational: simple terms and scan discipline
Owner: SCM / Logistics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
