    <bpmn:process id="W_W3533" name="W3533. Pallet / RTI Loss, Damage &amp; Write-Off Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reconciliation variance (W3531); damage write-off; loss
Frequency: Continuous + monthly write-off
Volume: Pallet/RTI loss/damage at scale
Owner: SCM / Finance
Participants: SCM, Finance (links to VS-17/VS-35), DC (links to VS-04), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), Logistics (links to VS-06), AP/AR (links to VS-15/VS-16)
Source: workflow W3533 — Pallet / RTI Loss, Damage &amp; Write-Off Management</bpmn:documentation>
