      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3533_Start4" name="Reconciliation variance (W3531); damage write-off; loss">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3533_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3533_Task5" name="SCM/Loss Prevention investigate pallet/RTI loss and damage: root-cause (theft…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/Loss Prevention investigate pallet/RTI loss and damage: root-cause (theft links to VS-23, mis-placement, carrier loss, customer non-return, damage in handling), quantify the loss by type/location/custody, and assign responsibility/recovery (carrier charge W3511, customer charge W3532, internal write-off)
Responsible (R): SCM / Loss Prevention
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3533_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3533_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3533_Task6" name="SCM/DC manage damaged pallet/RTI: repair where economical, refurbish, or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: SCM/DC manage damaged pallet/RTI: repair where economical, refurbish, or scrap/dispose sustainably (links to VS-35.3/VS-73); capture repair cost vs replacement; manage the repair vendor (links to VS-34.2)
Responsible (R): SCM / DC
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3533_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3533_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3533_Task7" name="Finance/SCM manage the write-off and recovery: write off unrecovered loss to GL…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/SCM manage the write-off and recovery: write off unrecovered loss to GL (links to VS-17/VS-35), recover from responsible party (carrier/customer charge links to VS-15/VS-16), and report loss/damage rate and recovery to analytics (W3540) and loss prevention (links to VS-23); drive reduction
Responsible (R): Finance / SCM
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3533_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3533_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3533_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3533_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
