Frequency: Per receipt + monthly
Volume: ~72K inbound receipts/year
Owner: SCM / DC Operations
Participants: SCM, DC Operations (links to VS-04.1), Vendor Management (links to VS-03), AP (links to VS-15), Packaging Eng, Quality (links to VS-31)
Source: workflow W3534 — Inbound Vendor Pallet / RTI Compliance &amp; Chargeback</bpmn:documentation>
