      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3534_Task5" name="SCM/Packaging Eng define inbound pallet/RTI requirements in vendor terms (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/Packaging Eng define inbound pallet/RTI requirements in vendor terms (links to W3525): pallet type/standard, palletization pattern, stretch-wrap/strapping, label/placard, ISPM-15 (links to VS-87), and exchange/returnable terms; communicate via PO and vendor portal (links to VS-03.4)
Responsible (R): SCM / Packaging Eng / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Setup + per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3534_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3534_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3534_Task6" name="DC inspect inbound pallet/RTI compliance on receipt (links to VS-04.1/W1365)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC inspect inbound pallet/RTI compliance on receipt (links to VS-04.1/W1365): pallet type/condition, pattern, labeling, hazmat (links to VS-24.3), and exchange pallets (W3532); document non-compliance (wrong type, sub-standard, non-conforming ISPM-15) with evidence
Responsible (R): DC / Quality
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Per receipt</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3534_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3534_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3534_Task7" name="SCM/AP manage the chargeback for non-compliance (links to VS-03/W245): compute…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SCM/AP manage the chargeback for non-compliance (links to VS-03/W245): compute the cost/penalty, deduct on AP (links to VS-15) or vendor credit, dispute resolution, and track vendor compliance in the scorecard (links to VS-67/W3512); drive improvement
Responsible (R): SCM / AP / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): SCM Manager / Finance
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3534_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3534_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
