    <bpmn:process id="W_W3535" name="W3535. Pallet / RTI Reverse Logistics &amp; Retrieval" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: RTI at external locations (stores, customers, carriers); retrieval cycle
Frequency: Continuous + scheduled retrieval
Volume: RTI in the reverse loop
Owner: SCM / Logistics
Participants: SCM, Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-32), DC (links to VS-04), Store (links to VS-07), Carrier (links to VS-110), Customer (links to VS-11)
Source: workflow W3535 — Pallet / RTI Reverse Logistics &amp; Retrieval</bpmn:documentation>
