      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3535_Start4" name="RTI at external locations (stores, customers, carriers); retrieval cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3535_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3535_Task5" name="SCM/Logistics plan RTI retrieval from external locations (stores, customers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/Logistics plan RTI retrieval from external locations (stores, customers, carriers): identify RTI overdue/at-external (W3531), schedule backhaul/retrieval on outbound trucks (links to VS-06/W3507 backhaul), and prioritize high-value/high-shortage RTI; integrate to reverse logistics (links to VS-32)
Responsible (R): SCM / Logistics
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3535_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3535_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3535_Task6" name="DC/Logistics/Carrier execute retrieval: collect RTI on delivery backhaul (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC/Logistics/Carrier execute retrieval: collect RTI on delivery backhaul (links to VS-06), scan in on return to DC (W3531), sort/inspect/repair (W3533), and return to pool; manage customer/carrier-located RTI recovery (W3532) and escalation
Responsible (R): DC / Logistics / Carrier
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3535_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3535_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3535_Task7" name="SCM/Finance measure RTI cycle time, return rate, retrieval cost, and loss…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SCM/Finance measure RTI cycle time, return rate, retrieval cost, and loss (W3533); optimize the reverse network and backhaul utilization (links to VS-110/W3507); report to analytics (W3540) and governance (W3544)
Responsible (R): SCM / Finance
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3535_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3535_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3535_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3535_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3535_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-563 (ensure controlled execution — Pallet &amp; RTI Pool, Tracking &amp; Reconciliation (PA-111.2).) | - operational: tracking and retrieval; operational: backhaul consolidation
Owner: SCM / Logistics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
