    <bpmn:process id="W_W3536" name="W3536. Pallet / RTI Pool Reconciliation &amp; Pool-Provider Settlement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pool-provider billing cycle (rented pool); monthly reconciliation
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Rented/pooled pallet/RTI (e.g., CHEP/LOSAL)
Owner: Finance / SCM
Participants: Finance (links to VS-17/VS-15), SCM, Procurement (links to VS-03), Logistics (links to VS-06), Pool Provider, AP (links to VS-15)
Source: workflow W3536 — Pallet / RTI Pool Reconciliation &amp; Pool-Provider Settlement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3536_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3536_Lane1" name="SCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3536_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3536_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3536_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3536_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3536_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3536_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3536_Start4" name="Pool-provider billing cycle (rented pool); monthly reconciliation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3536_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3536_Task5" name="SCM/Finance reconcile the pool-provider account: issued/returned/lost pallets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: SCM/Finance reconcile the pool-provider account: issued/returned/lost pallets or RTI per the provider&#x27;s records vs BuildRight&#x27;s tracking (W3531), per-trip/day fees, loss/damage charges, and deposits; resolve discrepancies (scan errors, unreturned, timing)
Responsible (R): SCM / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3536_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3536_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3536_Task6" name="Finance/AP process the pool-provider invoice (links to VS-15/W7), validate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/AP process the pool-provider invoice (links to VS-15/W7), validate fees/charges vs contract (links to VS-03/VS-34), dispute errors, and allocate pool cost to operations/entities (links to W3514/VS-72); post to GL (links to VS-17.1)
Responsible (R): Finance / AP
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3536_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3536_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3536_Task7" name="SCM/Finance report pool-provider performance, cost, and loss rate to analytics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SCM/Finance report pool-provider performance, cost, and loss rate to analytics (W3540) and governance (W3544); evaluate own-vs-rent economics periodically (W3529) and manage provider QBR (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): SCM / Finance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3536_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3536_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3536_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3536_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3536_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-79 (ensure RTI &amp; pallet asset reconciliation.) | - operational: reconciliation and audit; operational: tracking and recovery
Owner: Finance / SCM</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
